        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Through Longbridge Financial LLC (“Longbridge”), a wholly-owned and consolidated subsidiary of our Operating Partnership, we are also in the business of originating, servicing, and investing in reverse mortgage loans.",
        "start_character": 5310,
        "end_character": 5527
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-013279",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-013279-b942ae90d9ba4274",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-013279",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are a Delaware corporation operating as a real estate investment trust (\"REIT\") and are listed on the New York Stock Exchange (\"NYSE\") under the symbol “EFC.” We were formed in July 2007 and became a publicly traded company following our initial public offering in October 2010.",
        "start_character": 4450,
        "end_character": 4731
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-013279",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-013279-b942ae90d9ba4274",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-013279",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are externally managed and advised by our Manager, an affiliate of Ellington, which is responsible for administering our business activities and day-to-day operations.",
        "start_character": 5528,
        "end_character": 5698
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-013279",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-013279-b942ae90d9ba4274",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-013279",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Furthermore, we believe that Ellington's extensive experience in buying, selling, analyzing, and structuring fixed income securities and loans, coupled with its broad access to market information and trading flows, provides us with a steady flow of opportunities to acquire assets with favorable trade executions.",
        "start_character": 21347,
        "end_character": 21660
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-013279",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-013279-b942ae90d9ba4274",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-013279",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In a repo, we sell an asset to a counterparty at a discounted value, or the \"Loan Amount,\" and simultaneously agree to repurchase the same asset from such counterparty at a specified later date at a price equal to the Loan Amount plus an interest charge.",
        "start_character": 26998,
        "end_character": 27252
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-013279",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-013279-b942ae90d9ba4274",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-013279",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Under the management agreement, we are required to reimburse our Manager for certain operating expenses that it incurs on our behalf in the performance of its duties, including, among other things, our allocable portion of the costs incurred by our Manager for certain dedicated or partially dedicated personnel, based on the portion of their working time and efforts spent on our matters and subject to approval of the reimbursed amounts by the Compensation Committee of our Board of Directors.",
        "start_character": 38254,
        "end_character": 38749
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-013279",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-013279-b942ae90d9ba4274",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-013279",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We are externally managed and advised by our Manager, an affiliate of Ellington, pursuant to a management agreement.",
        "start_character": 12293,
        "end_character": 12409
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-013279",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-013279-b942ae90d9ba4274",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-013279",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "By investing opportunistically in both loans and securities, as well as in loan originators, we believe that we are able to achieve attractive diversification and can take advantage of relative value across investment classes.",
        "start_character": 20850,
        "end_character": 21076
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-013279",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-013279-b942ae90d9ba4274",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-013279",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "Except as required by law, we are not obligated to, and do not intend to, update or revise any forward-looking statements, whether as a result of new information, future events, or otherwise.",
        "start_character": 4246,
        "end_character": 4437
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-013279",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-013279-b942ae90d9ba4274",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-013279",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "With respect to loans, we have tended to focus on underserved, niche market segments where inefficiencies exist, and where the segment's size or complexity could present a barrier to entry.",
